# --- Worker toolchain (P3 Stage 1) ---
# wrangler + its deps are ~206MB and are reinstalled by `npm ci` from the
# committed package-lock.json. The lockfile IS committed so deploys are
# reproducible; node_modules never is. The Worker source itself (src/,
# wrangler.toml, package.json) is part of the repo.
node_modules/
.wrangler/
